  characterNameEN: Miya
  characterNameKR: "\uBBF8\uC57C"
  sentencesEN:
  - With you, I can overcome any difficulty.
  - You're as precious to me as salmon.
  - This moment with everyone is truly precious.
  sentencesKR:
  - "\uB108\uC640 \uD568\uAED8\uB77C\uBA74 \uC5B4\uB5A4 \uC5B4\uB824\uC6C0\uB3C4
